@startuml BusinessSequenceDiagram
!theme plain

title Themis LexiGuard - End-to-End Business Sequence Diagram (PlantUML)

actor Farmer as "Nông hộ"
actor HTX as "Quản lý HTX"
actor Analyst as "Compliance Analyst"
actor Manager as "Compliance Manager"
actor CEO as "CEO / Owner"
participant API as "Express API Gateway"
participant Service as "Business Services"
participant AI as "AI & RAG Engine (Gemini)"
database DB as "Supabase PostgreSQL"
database Storage as "Supabase Storage"

== Giai đoạn 1: Thu thập GPS & Khai báo Vùng trồng (EUDR) ==
Farmer -> API: POST /api/farm-polygons (Ghi GPS / Draw Polygon)
API -> Service: Save farm geometry & calculate area (turf.js)
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO farm_polygons
DB --> API: 201 Created (farmPolygonId)

HTX -> API: POST /api/due-diligence-statements (Tạo DDS)
API -> Service: Validate farmer GPS list & assemble DDS
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO due_diligence_statements
HTX -> API: POST /api/due-diligence-authorizations (Ủy quyền chia sẻ)
API -> DB: INSERT INTO due_diligence_authorizations

== Giai đoạn 2: Quản lý Lô hàng & OCR Chứng từ ==
Analyst -> API: POST /api/products (Tạo sản phẩm Cà phê)
API -> DB: INSERT INTO products & product_markets
Analyst -> API: POST /api/products/:id/batches (Tạo Batch xuất khẩu)
API -> DB: INSERT INTO batches (status: draft)

Analyst -> API: GET /api/documents/upload-url
API --> Analyst: Return Supabase Signed Upload URL (5 mins)
Analyst -> Storage: PUT file trực tiếp (Lab Result / CO / Phytosanitary)
Analyst -> API: POST /api/documents (Confirm upload)
API -> Service: Dispatch Background Job (doc-processing)
Service -> AI: Gemini Vision OCR & Field Extraction
AI --> Service: Return Extracted JSON Schema
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO document_extractions (status: needs_review)

Analyst -> API: POST /api/documents/:id/confirm (Review & Confirm)
API -> DB: INSERT INTO document_versions (Snapshot locked)
API -> DB: UPDATE batches SET status = 'ready_for_check'

== Giai đoạn 3: AI Compliance Check Engine Execution ==
Analyst -> API: POST /api/compliance/checks (Bắt đầu Check)
API -> Service: Dispatch Compliance Worker Job
Service -> Service: Execute Deterministic Rules (MRL limits, Expiry, Batch code)
Service -> DB: Query pgvector (Hybrid RAG Search top-K regulation chunks)
DB --> Service: Return Regulation Chunks & Embeddings
Service -> AI: Execute Gemini 1.5 Orchestrator Prompt
AI --> Service: Return Zod-validated Compliance Output (Result, Findings, Citations)
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO compliance_checks, findings, finding_citations, reports

== Giai đoạn 4: Thẩm định Báo cáo & Approve ==
Manager -> API: GET /api/reports/:id (Review findings & citations)
API -> DB: SELECT report details
DB --> Manager: Render Report & Risk Score

alt Có lỗi / rủi ro phát hiện
    Manager -> API: POST /api/findings/:id/tasks (Giao Remediation Task)
    API -> DB: INSERT INTO remediation_tasks
    Analyst -> API: POST /api/tasks/:id/evidence (Upload bằng chứng)
    Analyst -> API: POST /api/compliance/checks/:id/recheck (Chạy lại Check)
else Hồ sơ đạt tiêu chuẩn
    Manager -> API: POST /api/reports/:id/approve (Phê duyệt Báo cáo)
    API -> DB: UPDATE reports SET status = 'approved' (Immutable)
    API -> Service: Trigger PDF Generator Worker (Puppeteer)
    Service -> Storage: Upload Approved PDF Report
end

CEO -> API: GET /api/dashboard/summary (Xem Dashboard & KPIs)
API -> DB: Query aggregated server-side metrics
DB --> CEO: Render Dashboard KPIs & Action Items

@enduml
